@@ -0,0 +1,79 @@
+I have installed flask.
+
+Now, in `api-server.py`, create an API server that uses the inference service.
+
+the server has the following endpoints:
+
+## `POST /predict_duration`
+
+example request:
+
+```json
+{
+  "language": {
+    "iso-639": "cmn",
+    "segmentation_format": "fastspeech2-pinyin-r"
+  },
+  "segments": [
+    { "text": "你", "phonemes": ["n", "i3"] },
+    { "text": "好", "phonemes": ["h", "ao3"] },
+    { "text": "，", "phonemes": ["sp"] },
+    { "text": "世", "phonemes": ["sh", "iii4"] },
+    { "text": "界", "phonemes": ["j", "ie4"] }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+example OK response (200):
+
+```json
+["ok", {
+  "ticksPerSecond": 22050,
+  "durations2d": [[123, 456], [789, 234], [567], [891, 345], [678, 912]]
+}]
+```
+
+example BAD response (400 (caller's fault)):
+
+```json
+["error", {
+  "message": "unsupported segmentation format `librispeech` for language `cmn`"
+}]
+```
+
+## `POST /generate_prosody`
+
+example request:
+
+```json
+{
+  "language": {
+    "iso-639": "cmn",
+    "segmentation_format": "fastspeech2-pinyin-r"
+  },
+  "segments": [
+    { "text": "你", "phonemes": ["n", "i3"] },
+    { "text": "好", "phonemes": ["h", "ao3"] },
+    { "text": "，", "phonemes": ["sp"] },
+    { "text": "世", "phonemes": ["sh", "iii4"] },
+    { "text": "界", "phonemes": ["j", "ie4"] }
+  ],
+  "durations2d": [[123, 456], [789, 234], [567], [891, 345], [678, 912]]
+}
+```
+
+`durations2d` is optional. If it is not in the request, the request handler
+calls `InferenceService.predict_duration` by itself.
+
+if `durations2d` is provided, its shape should be validated with `segments`.
+
+example OK response:
+
+```json
+["ok", {/* … */}]
+```
+
+where `{/* … */}` is the content of the prosody json. (returned by
+`generate_prosody_json`.)
+
+calling these endpoints should not result in files being outputted to the disk.
